            "kind": "HUNK_BASIS",
            "subjectId": "hunk:sha256:0101010101010101010101010101010101010101010101010101010101010101",
            "reasons": [
              "SUBJECT_TERM_BOUND_EXCEEDED"
            ],
            "relatedIds": [
              "evidence:sha256:0101010101010101010101010101010101010101010101010101010101010101"
            ],
            "authorityClass": "PRODUCER_DECLARED",
            "resolutionClass": "PROFILE_REQUIRED",
            "nextAction": "DEFINE_SUPPORTED_PROFILE"
          }
        ]
      },
      "assertions": [
        "CF-V0-010: a local term-bound abstention maps to SUBJECT_TERM_BOUND_EXCEEDED with PROFILE_REQUIRED and DEFINE_SUPPORTED_PROFILE.",
        "CF-V0-010: SUBJECT_TERM_BOUND_EXCEEDED is FIRST in the frozen retained order.",
        "CF-V0-021: the unrelated hunk still closes; a local abstention is not an operational failure."
      ]
    },
    {
